1
00:00:00,024 --> 00:00:00,944
(Alfred:)I'll go with you.

2
00:00:00,941 --> 00:00:02,191
(Leonard:)That still leaves me
here with him.

3
00:00:02,193 --> 00:00:03,723
Hang on, hang on!

4
00:00:03,727 --> 00:00:05,227
We're smart, we can
figure this out.

5
00:00:05,229 --> 00:00:08,699
Okay, so: Mary and Beverly
can't be together.

6
00:00:08,699 --> 00:00:11,869
Uh, Alfred and Beverly
can't be together.

7
00:00:11,869 --> 00:00:14,369
Leonard and I can't be together.

8
00:00:14,371 --> 00:00:17,121
Now, I could be with Alfred...

9
00:00:17,124 --> 00:00:18,744
but I don't like his face.

10
00:00:20,327 --> 00:00:21,747
Oh, here! I've got it!

11
00:00:21,745 --> 00:00:23,415
(Amy:)Who's ready for a wedding?

12
00:00:23,414 --> 00:00:25,744
(Sheldon:)Great, now I have
to start all over.

13
00:00:33,958 --> 00:00:36,128
(Wyatt:)So how's the world
of pharmaceuticals treating you?

14
00:00:36,127 --> 00:00:37,797
(Penny:)Pretty good. I actually
just got assigned

15
00:00:37,795 --> 00:00:39,175
(Penny:)a much better territory.

16
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:41,800
(Susan:)See what happens
when you work hard?

17
00:00:41,799 --> 00:00:45,189
(Randall:)Hey, she just sells drugs.
I had to make 'em.

18
00:00:46,103 --> 00:00:47,633
(Susan:)Okay, that's enough.

19
00:00:47,638 --> 00:00:50,388
(Susan:)No more drug talk
for the rest of this trip.

20
00:00:50,391 --> 00:00:52,811
(Wyatt:)I'll drink to that.

21
00:00:52,810 --> 00:00:53,730
(Susan:)Haven't you had enough?

22
00:00:53,728 --> 00:00:55,398
(Wyatt:)Penny drinks
more than I do.

23
00:00:55,396 --> 00:00:57,866
(Penny:)Well, I learned
from the best.

24
00:00:57,865 --> 00:01:00,025
Aw!
Aw!

